<p>Insurers pay for damage they can see, measure, and tie to a covered event. That is why knowing <strong>how to document hail damage for an insurance claim</strong> matters so much in Corpus Christi and across the Coastal Bend. Clear, dated, organized evidence helps an adjuster understand what happened, when it happened, and what it will take to repair. Thin evidence leaves gaps, and gaps tend to turn into low estimates, extra inspections, or denials.</p>

